# ---------------------------------------------------
# Third-party / re-downloadable content
#
# If content is licensed and can't be redistributed, or is free-but-large
# and re-downloadable from its source (a marketplace/Fab pack, a sample
# import), ignore it here and add a row to Docs/AssetSources.md documenting
# what it is and where to get it back on a fresh clone. Don't let this
# section stay empty by default once the project pulls in paid/marketplace
# content (per GameDevPlan.md §5, expected once the art pass starts) - an
# empty list here on a real project usually means someone forgot.
#
# Example entries (uncomment/adapt once real paths exist):
# Content/SomeMarketplacePack/
# Content/SampleProjectImport/
